          }
        ],
        "date": "2013-06-06",
        "description": "At the suggestion of Michael Madden, changed trimmedPilotControl_throttle and trimmedPilotControl_long variables into inputs. While their trimmed values are given for my Simulink sim, small difference in atmosphere and gravitation models may require slightly different values in other implementations.",
